00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:18.380
if you wanted to.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.940
We'll start a whole new style of painting.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.960
That quick, we got the canvas all cut.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.840
Cover it up and it's ready.

