pull it down, go across, maybe under here.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:41.060
See there, see there?

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.920
That easy, you can create all kinds of little peninsulas,

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:50.330
little projections out into the water, whatever, whatever.

